    questionText: "The function g(x) = 2x² + px + q, where p, q ∈ ℤ, and x ∈ ℝ. Given that g(2) = 6 and g′(3) = 9, find the value of p and the value of q. Note: g′(3) is the value of the derivative of g(x) at x = 3.",
