    stem: "The table below shows the total rainfall, in millimetres, and the total sunshine, in hours, at Valentia, County Kerry, during the month of June from 2001 to 2010. Total rainfall and total sunshine at Valentia in June. Year: 2001, 2002, 2003, 2004, 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008, 2009, 2010. Total Rainfall (mm): 72, 133, 155, 101, 94, 47, 149, 134, 94, 84. Total Sunshine (hours): 169, 124, 180, 173, 173, 239, 159, 168, 228, 205. (Source: Met Éireann)",
